export default async function Page() {
  'use cache'
  // All fetches here are cached
  return <div>...</div>
}
```

## Following validation

Cache Components validates your routes in development and surfaces errors and insights in the dev overlay. Some look like this, naming the affected component and pointing at a fix:

<FixCardGrid>
  <FixCard
    group="cache"
    title="Cache the component or data"
    href="/docs/messages/blocking-prerender-dynamic#cache-the-component-or-data"
    snippets={[
      { text: 'async function Posts() {' },
      { text: '  "use cache"', highlight: true },
